  best degree by validation error: 3

[B] Learning curves: does MORE DATA help?
  degree= 1: cv-train gap    0.033 (n=25) -> 0.004 (n=320);  final cv MSE = 0.268
  degree=12: cv-train gap  433.901 (n=25) -> 0.006 (n=320);  final cv MSE = 0.090
  Reading: high-bias model -> curves converge HIGH (more data won't help);
           high-variance model -> big gap that SHRINKS with more data.

